# Generated trees. `setuptools` rewrites `*.egg-info/` on every build, so under
# version control it disagrees with the working tree between builds and nothing
# notices. The rest are caches and a local environment.
#
# Every entry here was ignored only by a contributor's GLOBAL ignore file or by
# nothing at all, which is why one of them reached a commit.
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
